# Cache rules for Cloudflare Pages (Workers static assets read this file);
# other hosts ignore it. The same three tiers scripts/deploy-s3.sh applies
# to a bucket — a test keeps them in step.
#
# Every matching rule contributes its headers, so a narrower rule first
# detaches (`! `) the Cache-Control a wider one added, then sets its own.
# Order: general to specific.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/assets/img/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
